{
  "name": "Monitor ATS job boards and post AI-scored job alerts to Slack and Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "255f6970-be71-4522-8e8c-784489e81a99",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -624,
        -176
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 496,
        "height": 928,
        "content": "## Hiring signals from eight ATS platforms, scored before they reach you\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Every weekday the workflow reads your company watchlist from a Google Sheet. Plain company names are enough; a career page URL is only needed when a name is ambiguous.\n2. The [ATS Job Scraper](https://apify.com/sauliusautomatesit/ats-job-scraper) Actor on Apify auto-detects each company's applicant tracking system - Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby, Workday, Workable, SmartRecruiters, Recruitee or BambooHR - and reads the jobs straight from it.\n3. Monitoring mode plus a stable monitor id means each posting is returned exactly once, ever. There is no local dedupe list to maintain and you are never charged twice for the same job.\n4. An LLM scores every new posting from 0 to 100 against the role profile you wrote in **Settings**, with a one-line reason drawn from the posting itself.\n5. Every job is archived to a Google Sheet, and only the ones above your threshold are posted to Slack. A short roll-up message confirms the scan ran even on a quiet day.\n\n### Setup\n\n- [ ] Create a free Apify account and copy your API token from Settings, API & Integrations.\n- [ ] Add an **HTTP Header Auth** credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`, and select it on the three Apify HTTP nodes.\n- [ ] Connect your Google Sheets, OpenAI and Slack credentials.\n- [ ] Make a spreadsheet with a `Companies` tab (columns `Company`, `Career page URL`) and a `Jobs` tab, then paste its id into **Settings**.\n- [ ] Rewrite `roleProfile` in **Settings** to describe what you actually want, and paste your Slack channel id into `slackChannelId`.\n\n### Customization\n\nUse it for competitor hiring intelligence, sales signals or your own job hunt - only `roleProfile` changes. Raise or lower `minScore` after a week of real data."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0bdf5226-711c-453a-886a-e157450efe14",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
