        "color": 7,
        "width": 832,
        "height": 288,
        "content": "## Daily trigger and company watchlist\n\nThe companies you track live in a Google Sheet. The Settings node holds the role profile that drives the scoring."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f9ceefbb-2a86-461d-89f3-1959bacfb43d",
