      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 880,
        "height": 688,
        "content": "## Read every ATS board through Apify\n\nOne asynchronous run covers the whole watchlist and is polled until it finishes, so a long company list never hits the five-minute synchronous limit."
